          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomo Wakenza bintu bionso biakatekeye mu nsubu wa Yehowa wakenza tshioshelu ne tshiamu tshia or, ne mesa a or a kutekahu mampa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne bitekelu bia minda biakadi bia or, bitanu ku tshianza tshia balume ne bitanu ku tshianza tshia bakashi ku mpala kua muaba wa tshijila, ne bilongo ne minda ne nkuatu biakadi bia or; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "makoho ne lukuatu lua kujima nʼalu minda, ne bihanza ne nkutu ne malonga a kutekamu kahia biakadi bia or; ne biamu bia bibi bionso bia mu nsubu ne bia ku muaba mutambe wa tshijila biakadi bia or.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
