              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku mudimu wakenza mukelenge Solomo mu nsubu wa Yehowa wakashikishibua. Solomo wakalua ne bintu bionso biakajidila tatu wandi Davidi Nzambi, bintu bia argent ne bia or ne malonga onso, wakabiteka mu bibu tshilu bia mu nsubu wa Yehowa.",
          "type": "text",
